# Data Paths

External dataset locations come from machine-local configs (`code/configs/paths.local.yaml`, `datasets/*.local.yaml`), never from hard-coded absolute paths in Python or experiment YAMLs. Treat configured RAW trees as read-only.

All runnable configs live under `code/configs/`. Experiment manifests use logical keys (`processed_manifest` / `shu_processed_manifest`). New processed outputs must follow the local path config; do not invent external write locations unless the user explicitly approves a safe path. Do not commit filled `*.local.yaml`.
